{
  "id": "1CH.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Chronicles 16",
  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They took the Covenant Box to the tent which David had prepared for it and put it inside. Then they offered sacrifices and fellowship offerings to God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After David had finished offering the sacrifices, he blessed the people in the name of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and distributed food to them all. He gave each man and woman in Israel a loaf of bread, a piece of roasted meat,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "a piece of roasted meat",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "a cake of dates.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and some raisins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David appointed some of the Levites to lead the worship of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, in front of the Covenant Box, by singing and praising him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaph was appointed leader, with Zechariah as his assistant. Jeiel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Mattithiah, Eliab, Benaiah, Obed Edom, and Jeiel were to play harps. Asaph was to sound the cymbals, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and two priests, Benaiah and Jahaziel, were to blow trumpets regularly in front of the Covenant Box. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was then that David first gave Asaph and his fellow-Levites the responsibility for singing praises to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then all the people said, “Amen”, and praised the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King David put Asaph and his fellow-Levites in permanent charge of the worship that was held at the place where the Covenant Box was kept. They were to perform their duties there day by day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obed Edom son of Jeduthun and 68 men of his clan were to assist them. Hosah and Obed Edom were in charge of guarding the gates.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zadok the priest and his fellow-priests, however, were in charge of the worship of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " at the place of worship in Gibeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every morning and evening they were to burn sacrifices whole on the altar in accordance with what was written in the Law which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gave to Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There with them were Heman and Jeduthun and the others who were specifically chosen to sing praises to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " for his eternal love. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heman and Jeduthun also had charge of the trumpets and cymbals and the other instruments which were played when the songs of praise were sung. The members of Jeduthun's clan were in charge of guarding the gates.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.16.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
